### Acknowledgements & Credits

This project benefits from and is inspired by the following open-source works:

- **[wx-cli-again](https://github.com/jackwener/wx-cli-again)** (@jackwener): Outstanding reverse engineering research on WeChat 4.x for macOS, including the V2 image key derivation algorithms, SQLCipher 4 database structure insights, and Mach VM / LLDB memory key extraction mechanisms.
- **[Motrix](https://github.com/agalwood/Motrix)**: Clean and minimal macOS desktop application visual language and sidebar design inspiration.
- **[Pearcleaner](https://github.com/alienator88/Pearcleaner)**: Modern macOS cleaner design paradigms, specifically the floating capsule action bar and user experience flows.
